(text ".tran 5n 16u" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d5a8cad2-fb44-40e9-86c5-db513438f2d2"))
(text ".meas tran y0 find v(/OUT) at=1.95u\n.meas tran y1 find v(/OUT) at=3.95u\n.meas tran y2 find v(/OUT) at=5.95u\n.meas tran y3 find v(/OUT) at=7.95u\n.meas tran y4 find v(/OUT) at=9.95u\n.meas tran y5 find v(/OUT) at=11.95u\n.meas tran y6 find v(/OUT) at=13.95u\n.meas tran y7 find v(/OUT) at=15.95u\n.meas tran lvh find v(/IN_A) at=3.95u\n.meas tran lvl find v(/IN_A) at=1.95u\n.meas tran ylh find v(/OUT_LV) at=1.95u\n.meas tran yll find v(/OUT_LV) at=5.95u\n.meas tran amin min v(/IN_A) from=0.5u to=16u\n.meas tran bmin min v(/IN_B) from=0.5u to=16u\n.meas tran ymin min v(/OUT_LV) from=0.5u to=16u\n.meas tran tphl_b trig v(/IN_B) val=-5 rise=1 td=3.9u targ v(/OUT) val=100 fall=1 td=3.9u\n.meas tran tplh_a trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 fall=1 td=5.9u targ v(/OUT) val=100 rise=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran lv_lh trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 fall=1 td=5.9u targ v(/OUT_LV) val=-5 rise=1 td=5.9u\n.meas tran tphl_a trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 rise=1 td=9.9u targ v(/OUT) val=100 fall=1 td=9.9u\n.meas tran lv_hl trig v(/IN_A) val=-5 rise=1 td=9.9u targ v(/OUT_LV) val=-5 fall=1 td=9.9u\n.meas tran tplh_b trig v(/IN_B) val=-5 fall=1 td=11.9u targ v(/OUT) val=100 rise=1 td=11.9u" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9c0052ae-3f60-4b32-8018-e478e0825d55"))
(text "NAND2_J2 testbench. 2 us per input state, DUT (A,B) = 00 10 11 01 01 11 10 00: each input switches Y both ways.\nSTIM_x (HV, ideal) -> divider -> driver gate (inputs tied) -> divider -> IN_x (LV): real edges and levels on the DUT grids.\nDivider C1 = 3.9 pF per g1 grid + 6.8 pF per g3 grid: IN_A 3.9 pF, IN_B 6.8 pF, driver inputs 10.7 pF.\nOUT (HV) -> one divider (C1 = 5 x 10.7 pF) -> OUT_LV -> 5 load gates, inputs tied = fanout 10 (5 g1 + 5 g3).\nPlot V(/IN_A) V(/IN_B) V(/OUT) V(/OUT_LV); .meas results: y0..y7 = OUT at the end of each state, tphl_a/b, tplh_a/b." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "24f9debb-40ad-4811-9f53-f558a084fbfc"))
